 - **[Astro DB](https://docs.astro.build/en/guides/database/)**: Powers the comments feature, using a libSQL-compatible database.
+
+## Agent form tools
+
+The sign-in and sign-up pages expose `sign_in` and `sign_up` through the
+[WebMCP Declarative API](https://developer.chrome.com/docs/ai/webmcp/declarative-api).
+Each tool is available while its form is on the page and accepts the required
+`username` and `password` parameters. Account submissions retain the browser's
+user review step (`toolautosubmit` is intentionally omitted).
+
+Both tools use the same submission handler as manual form submissions and return
+`{ success, message }` after the request completes, including API and network
+failures. Credentials and authentication tokens are not included in tool results.
+Browsers without WebMCP support ignore the annotations and use the forms normally.
